# The bundled icon set, for scripts/gen_icons.py.
#
#   <name> <filled> <outlined> <rounded> <sharp> [mirror]
#
# Codepoints in hex, `-` where the set has no icon in that style. Names are
# the set's own, with the digit-leading ones spelled out so that they are
# valid identifiers. `mirror` marks an icon that carries a direction and must
# be turned round for a right-to-left reading order — an arrow, an indent, a
# reply. Generated from the font's own manifest; do not hand-edit.
